The priest won't be associated with the altar in any way, since the
room is not defined as a "temple". A "temple" already has a priest of
the altar's alignment when it is generated: otherwise it's just a
freestanding altar. Priests can hit hard and summon plagues of
insects - the latter being annoying when they get in your way, or good
when they get in the monster's way.

