Sacrificing on it, *provided her alignment is in credit*, may convert
the altar (and make her own god pleased) - or reduce her luck if it
fails. If her alignment is below zero, she risks converting herself to
the altar's alignment, if the altar is not aligned to Moloch (in which
case both your own god and Moloch will simply try to kill you and get
angry.)

DO NOT SACRIFICE ON ANY ALTAR IN THE VALLEY OF THE DEAD OR LOWER. NOT
IF YOU VALUE YOUR CHARACTER'S LIFE.

